{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/MSaqjxTciVOp57BNa0CJqw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:31.572341+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/MSaqjxTciVOp57BNa0CJqw","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/2pCp7qzL7SQjiaIRIQ7U3iaw0Gf8bLlm1xkLDpfEYykGlE3eO3f4zOXAtUvOYic6q4uowR4IzbogSCC2YVpWpBHGueEmR8NcM7KKc6ADNhFnps/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p>夏天的风，总是适合装点梦想</p><p>这个七月，它吹进了良渚实验室——</p><p><br/></p><p>这里有显微镜下隐藏的星辰大海</p><p>有试管中的精妙反应</p><p>有和你一样充满朝气和懵懂的灵魂</p><p>还有一场正在发芽的科学奇遇</p><p><br/></p><p>良渚实验室2026年度</p><p>优秀大学生夏令营</p><p>现已启动报名</p><p>加入我们，让这个夏季</p><p>托举起你闪闪发光的人生梦想</p><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/2pCp7qzL7SQaepibb8Dx4u9OhM5zyFMC7ctvfeqBKIDnlp7bgXhJDv0romSYrVQxen7OIbcJwMR0UOF03CecvSdJicN3iagN5sjZibmJ7LzGNQM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b>了解</b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/btLkCxjz5dJjOLJmGyvdjiaRUyAL4sOIBDOfQ2K7qKI4hrez6OrMiaicEVibGEBXFNqV6kEV9SdXu3IAFw7s6XksfLQgULdvKf0GLg33z8AOhrM/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>良渚实验室</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><p>良渚实验室（系统医学与精准诊治浙江省实验室）是首批浙江省实验室，由浙江大学举办，2020年7月挂牌成立。实验室现有遗传与系统性疾病、血液与免疫疾病、重大神经精神疾病及再生医学与衰老干预四大科研主攻方向。实验室定位为大学和生命健康行业交界面的战略科技力量，通过机制创新和科技创新“双轮驱动”，有机荟聚国内外“四支科创队伍”，立体推进科学高峰、先进治疗、产业动力“三大攻关任务”，致力打造具有良渚特征的“基础、临床和产业一体化”发展模式，探索生物医学领域新质生产力发展新路径。实验室还积极探索具有良渚特征的“教科人一体化”，通过举办双创大赛及双创博士学院，开展博士层级的教育，培育一批双创型博士人才队伍及高科技生物医药企业。</p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b>2026夏令营</b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/btLkCxjz5dJjOLJmGyvdjiaRUyAL4sOIBDOfQ2K7qKI4hrez6OrMiaicEVibGEBXFNqV6kEV9SdXu3IAFw7s6XksfLQgULdvKf0GLg33z8AOhrM/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>申请条件</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQIsWuSpcHWM4ib5rYtickRSyhO3zu3S6RLjMYBe7tibkonibGs2QLGe5U3NNVic05luicicn4XSWCbh3brhxztWXEqePjaLQnEMpZcdVc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQIsWuSpcHWM4ib5rYtickRSyhO3zu3S6RLjMYBe7tibkonibGs2QLGe5U3NNVic05luicicn4XSWCbh3brhxztWXEqePjaLQnEMpZcdVc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>欢迎全国优秀大学医学、药学、生物学、农学、生物医学工程、计算生物学、  化学等生命科学相关专业及交叉学科专业的2027届优秀本科毕业生申请。</p><p>基本要求：</p><p>1. 学习成绩优秀，预期能获得推免资格并对科研有浓厚的兴趣，愿意从事学术研究工作；</p><p>2. 英语能力优秀，满足以下条件其中一项：</p><p>1) 全国大学英语六级考试（CET-6）成绩原则上480分及以上；</p><p>2) 新托福（TOEFL）考试成绩90分及以上；</p><p>3) 雅思（IELTS）成绩6.0分及以上；</p><p>4) 英语专业八级合格；</p><p>（PS：未达到以上英语水平条件，但科研业绩突出或学术潜力优秀的申请人，经审定，英语水平要求可放宽到全国大学英语六级考试（CET-6）460分）</p><p></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b>2026夏令营</b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/btLkCxjz5dJjOLJmGyvdjiaRUyAL4sOIBDOfQ2K7qKI4hrez6OrMiaicEVibGEBXFNqV6kEV9SdXu3IAFw7s6XksfLQgULdvKf0GLg33z8AOhrM/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>报名方式</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section></section> </section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>报名时间：从即日起至6月2日24:00截止，逾期不受理。（请同学打开钉钉扫一扫，进入钉钉群，关注后续日程信息以及开营时间）</p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section> </section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/2pCp7qzL7SSbGRib9PicLaCGmgmwtYM9iaWHNZreE8ibt9iaZ2ibobIz3XiaNicJbsgx6lf1zN3YywUpNcJ4AY7QUYC7TBAIcrMF7UMYMiaPhcjOR6yE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><p>1、申请者请登录浙江大学研究生院招生管理系统，链接地址：https://yjsy.zju.edu.cn/grsinfo/zs/user/login，注册后进行网上报名。填写信息并上传材料后，可下载“申请表”。</p><p><strong>（注：登录后意向学院选择——医学院，意向二级单位栏目选择——良渚实验室）</strong></p><p>2、请将所有证明材料原件<strong>按以下顺序扫描并整合成PDF文件，压缩为ZIP文件（不超过10M）后，在网申系统的“附件”中上传</strong>，文件名为<strong>“良渚实验室-姓名-所在本科院校”</strong>。</p><p>⑴. 个人身份证（正反面）；</p><p>⑵. 本科阶段成绩单及本专业年级排名证明（注明专业总人数和排名）各一份，需加盖教务处或院系公章；</p><p>⑶. 外语水平证明材料（CET6、托福、雅思等）;</p><p>⑷. 其他材料：如个人简历、已发表论文、各类获奖或资格证书等。</p><p>以上所有材料需真实有效，<strong>若发现申请人有弄虚作假行为，将取消其申请资格并通报申请人所在本科院校。</strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b>2026夏令营</b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/btLkCxjz5dJjOLJmGyvdjiaRUyAL4sOIBDOfQ2K7qKI4hrez6OrMiaicEVibGEBXFNqV6kEV9SdXu3IAFw7s6XksfLQgULdvKf0GLg33z8AOhrM/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>审核及入选</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p>良渚实验室将组织专家组进行资格审查，<strong>审查结果将于6月中旬在良渚实验室官网（http://liangzhulab.zju.edu.cn/）、报名系统及钉钉群公布。</strong>申请者可进入报名系统查看学院初审意见，<strong>入选者也将收到邮件通知，未入选者不另行通知。收到入选</strong><strong>通知的同学需在截止时间前登录系统，确认是否参加，逾期未确认视为放弃资格。</strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b>2026夏令营</b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/btLkCxjz5dJjOLJmGyvdjiaRUyAL4sOIBDOfQ2K7qKI4hrez6OrMiaicEVibGEBXFNqV6kEV9SdXu3IAFw7s6XksfLQgULdvKf0GLg33z8AOhrM/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b>活动安排</b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section><section><section><section> </section></section></section></section><section><section><p>开营仪式、学科专业介绍、师生互动、营员面谈、参观交流等。（具体日程安排后续会在“钉钉”群里通知，敬请关注）。</p></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b>2026夏令营</b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/btLkCxjz5dJjOLJmGyvdjiaRUyAL4sOIBDOfQ2K7qKI4hrez6OrMiaicEVibGEBXFNqV6kEV9SdXu3IAFw7s6XksfLQgULdvKf0GLg33z8AOhrM/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b>营员待遇</b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><p>良渚实验室为<strong>外地高校营员</strong>提供免费食宿，并可报销来杭交通费（上限不超过800元，限火车硬座/卧铺席、动车/高铁二等座、飞机经济舱），入营报到时须提供纸质票据（飞机提供订单记录或登机牌+发票或航空运输电子客票行程单）进行报销。入选9月推免复试的营员，可报销返程交通费（标准同来杭交通费）。本次夏令营不收取注册费。实验室将为每位营员购买夏令营活动期间的人身意外保险。</p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b>2026夏令营</b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/btLkCxjz5dJjOLJmGyvdjiaRUyAL4sOIBDOfQ2K7qKI4hrez6OrMiaicEVibGEBXFNqV6kEV9SdXu3IAFw7s6XksfLQgULdvKf0GLg33z8AOhrM/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>注意事项</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section><section><section><p>1、参加夏令营的学生必须遵守浙江大学相关规定，按照良渚实验室的统一安排参加各项活动，注意安全，并保持手机畅通；</p><p>2、营员报到后要求参与夏令营全程活动，擅自离营者将被取消资格，本单位将不承担其任何费用；</p><p>3、营员交通费补贴报销工作预计在10月底前完成，逾期未提供票据的，视为自愿放弃交通费报销；</p><p>4、住宿暂定7月初两晚；</p><p></p><p>5、申请者可登录良渚实验室官网—人才培养—研究生，查看导师个人主页，欢迎同学们提前与意向导师联络。</p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b>联系</b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/btLkCxjz5dJjOLJmGyvdjiaRUyAL4sOIBDOfQ2K7qKI4hrez6OrMiaicEVibGEBXFNqV6kEV9SdXu3IAFw7s6XksfLQgULdvKf0GLg33z8AOhrM/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>方式</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><p><br/></p><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section></section> </section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>联系人：王老师</p><p>联系电话：0571-88790286</p><p>联系邮箱：wyying@zju.edu.cn</p><p>通讯地址：浙江省杭州市余杭区文一西路1369号良渚实验室</p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><b>往期夏令营精彩片刻</b></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/2pCp7qzL7SSACEj9NbeMXpwtiakTdlI2Q76jKLDSib1dKquRf6iaprM2lpz3BjRSP7uFYXwEFWX7Lu3bCpIibmUUj1ZbuuvI5PmSbLpib3lZ54vg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/2pCp7qzL7SSqpLibpnvI1Gr6vCvh9xvpJTibsvicrrZibNI2ianVI2GM35R8NzNbsRm5NC35HLjVNRqQwDxicKFWLsocViaDg6lb4wLW286ZsBvJVI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/2pCp7qzL7SSlEIJ6HsSuSyMLMzMkAIibqXszxdq25WYXlycdfcss82HYw9XXpXTI1PM0XP5nHlpIBQW1QW1CT8DBrtsSj1ic4ytDlaaTHGuVo/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/2pCp7qzL7SQHg1uttrkgNLcAqDa4VMgVv7YrScH8GFOibaAo9Wdsb7lm3sL3a62RbNiciatFfY9eq6Q4V5qMnSTntvPlWicKcsMNG30nFCwc1UM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/2pCp7qzL7SS5gIxv1ib2LlUagZVib6vfcx1BMfDKUPkicx0278D5qQwTDlWYzMdWI32xODUUrqZ5zMoiafqorMpoTVyYUSpPhyACrVJx8uhuibhs/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/2pCp7qzL7STWiaabiaq2TVN37pq1RRzFibOYJsBdyzvKbywmRHuicvD22JqB0IkVaUdcbhIiaIOkgjZiaXvjB4UOZme13VpGO1sG8HdGRfT47s694/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/2pCp7qzL7SRp6CJK483uJIkZ7czzogETPmgWNsOWib3zibggjUkSGbB9DoEtvProd8pPeW70nbf6Imo73TLPqBezcZBgflib7GcFqvvCicYYpFk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>More</p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section> </section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p>这个七月</p><p>期待我们在良渚实验室相遇</p><p>三天时间，恰好够一粒种子发芽</p><p>夏季会结束，但梦想不会停歇<br/></p><p>让这个夏天</p><p>成为你人生中的闪亮篇章</p><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/2pCp7qzL7SR3nPj4fss7Fj5oplTE34iaYoLosbodQJ0kpjs3YcicyiaxntbJBicx44PorTBvujOY3Jj7SQe0ws5ATlVOxzzRS6t2NTDqlaxibMfs/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"29e68ad5e5fb66576f23db784e09b2ccb884567267c95f7e5816565eb9ac7d0c","textLength":1999,"sourceSha256":"72f5d32a50560cf8a20479795d333eda3021ec62b204de0f607bbb5a6abb8941","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-3412d416a7a6e2f8bc8a","title":"2026年浙江大学良渚实验室2026年度优秀大学生夏令营报名开启","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:31.572341+00:00"}
